g the President's Commission on Federal Ethics Law Reform.\n(d) Executive Order No. 12607, establishing the President's Commission on Privatization.\n(e) Executive Order No. 12296, as amended by Executive Order No. 12309, establishing the President's Economic Policy Advisory Board.\n(f) Executive Order No. 12528, as amended by Exeuctive Order No. 12604, establishing the Presidential Board of Advisors on Private Sector Initiatives.\n(g) Executive Order No. 12601, as amended by Executive Order No. 12603, establishing the Presidential Commission on the Human Immunodeficiency Virus Epidemic.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); Sec. 3(a)","sha256":"0082d6bb18511a9f088cd371f7f510a6dc7240f5db13af09fd417297abbfa507","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12692-continuance-certain-federal-advisory-committees"},"scope_id":"EO:12692#sec3(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 4. Executive Order No. 12610 is superseded.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); Sec. 4","sha256":"0082d6bb18511a9f088cd371f7f510a6dc7240f5db13af09fd417297abbfa507","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12692-continuance-certain-federal-advisory-committees"},"scope_id":"EO:12692#sec4","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 5. This order shall be effective September 30, 1989.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); Sec. 5","sha256":"0082d6bb18511a9f088cd371f7f510a6dc7240f5db13af09fd417297abbfa507","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-12692-continuance-certain-federal-advisory-committees"},"scope_id":"EO:12692#sec5","state_at_cutoff":null}],"o